{%- comment -%} Sound familiar — lead-in. Ported from Home.jsx (lead). Base color red. {%- endcomment -%}

<section class="lead" style="--c: var(--red); color: var(--red);">
  <div class="lead__stat" data-reveal>
    <span class="lead__stat-num">95%</span>
    <span class="lead__stat-copy">
      <span class="lead__stat-lead">of people don't get enough fiber.</span>
      <span class="lead__stat-sub">Most already know they should get more. Off Menu just makes it a chew you'll actually look forward to.</span>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="lead__row">
    <div class="lead__text">
      <span class="lead__eyebrow" data-reveal>Sound familiar?</span>
      <h2 class="lead__head" data-reveal="big">Ever feel fine in the morning, then weirdly puffy by lunch?</h2>
      <p class="lead__body" data-reveal>We have all tried to solve that heavy, bloated feeling with more water, cleaner meals, another green thing, or just pretending our jeans did not fit differently two hours ago.</p>
      <p class="lead__body" data-reveal>Sometimes the simple answer is the one we overlook. A little more fiber, taken consistently, can help support digestion, regularity, fullness, and the daily rhythm of how you feel after eating.</p>
      <p class="lead__kicker serif" data-reveal>Small habit. Less bloat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lead__art">
      {% render 'ill', src: 'Walking.svg', w: 460, h: 460 %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .lead { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 52px; padding: 84px 80px 100px; }
  .lead__stat { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 46px); padding-bottom: 48px; border-bottom: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 22%, #fff); }
  .lead__stat-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(72px, 11vw, 132px); line-height: 0.82; color: var(--c); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .lead__stat-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .lead__stat-lead { font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 30px); line-height: 1.08; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: var(--c); }
  .lead__stat-sub { font-weight: 500; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink); max-width: 560px; }
  .lead__row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 60px; }
  .lead__text { max-width: 600px; }
  .lead__eyebrow { display: block; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lead__head { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 62px); line-height: 1.02; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.015em; padding: 14px 0 4px; }
  .lead__body { font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: var(--ink); padding-top: 16px; }
  .lead__kicker { font-style: italic; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--c); padding-top: 24px; }
  .lead__art { flex-shrink: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .lead__row { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 40px; }
    .lead__stat { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 36px; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Lead", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "Lead" }] }
{% endschema %}
